Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cups (>= 2.2), cups-filters | cups-filters-core-drivers
Description: CUPS filter for Toshiba e-STUDIO 2323AM (GDI models)
 The e-STUDIO 2323AM and 2823AM are host-based (GDI) devices: they carry no
 PCL or PostScript interpreter, so the page must be rasterised on the host
 and encoded into a vendor-private stream.
 .
 This package provides a CUPS filter (rastertotoshiba) that accepts
 application/vnd.cups-raster from the standard CUPS filter chain,
 encodes each page into the device stream and writes it to the backend
 (socket:// or usb://).
 .
 The same source builds on amd64 and arm64; there is no vendor binary and
 no architecture-specific code.
